1790112438407903	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyxxA		item.comment	bn-2g3ei	{"body":"ws bn-2g3ei HEAD 331f993. New daemon/terminal.rs: TerminalRecord, a sibling internal record in the existing task_ class (format tag continuum.task-terminal-record/1; not a cont_ revision because a first-run close or failure has no cont_ handle). Written in verification::advance: Completed = terminal record before the closing campaign record (campaign index commit = commit point); Failed = terminal record is the only write and its commit point. resolve_tasks: matching terminal record -> Resolution::Terminal(Completed|Failed), restored as a live terminal TaskEntry; non-matching -> unclaimed; two -> Failed(AmbiguousTerminal). Settled now only for pre-bone stores; supersede-and-rerun kept for them only. verification.result/await and the start cached lane re-derive the CheckReport of a restored Completed task from durable model/target/bounds (pure, no region, no write), checked against the durable state count. No IDL/protocol/schema change. Tests: G1-08 completed + failed task.status/result/start byte-identical after restart, aborted-campaign terminal record unclaimed, legacy Settled supersede; recovery + terminal unit tests; matrix sweeps (8,18,1) and (8,9,9,1); G1-06 census: task.resume is a publisher (9 publishers, 66 non-publishing ops); G1-01/G1-04 counts; G1-06 mixed cadence nth 3->4. Item 3 (durable resume budget write) not cheap: breaks G1-04/G1-05 negative controls; continuation.rs doc left. just check: all green."}	blake3:vR71CaABI6kM3eJ4VCCbd7kqXwloDiNIB_V_mb7tyL4
