1790142959878043	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy5RI		item.comment	bn-2ouro	{"body":"Relational actions landed in ws bn-2ouro (ad87ad1, synced onto a82b604). RFC 0003 'Relational actions' + correction 2 (completes docs/11 §4): post-state reads x' of state vars only; conjuncts reading post-state are postconditions; frame rule: each var updated, kept, or relational (primed by a postcondition), else unspecified_state_change; primed reads of updated/kept vars normalize to post values. Lowering: one action per candidate A[r=c,...], domain product in name order, last fastest, ascending; MAX_RELATIONAL_CANDIDATES=2^16; successor_work charged before building. SyntaxCoverage elaborates (golden), lowering refused Fairness then NonStandardBehavior. Tests: tests/relational.rs (10: frame, normalization, refusals, successor differential vs Rust oracle + oracle mutants, engine graph vs hand graph + mutant, metamorphic identity), 5 new resource_bounds tests. Record tools/governance/reviews/bn-2ouro.toml without security_review. just check green except governance security-review-present (lead-owned); dossier, lean, test-policy pass."}	blake3:vpSq3iWWq6Snm_dnUPco98Raqmq6vHf_BdKO43up8rQ
