1790146320846989	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyiRM		item.comment	bn-3kql	{"body":"KILL-09 package ready at 0f5bc08 (workspace bn-3kql, not merged). Indicator: kill09_intent_diff_indicator.rs, artifact 'continuum-semantic-diff kill09-indicator v1' plus trend file tests/golden/kill09_indicator_trend.txt (T1 DX-02, T2 C020, T3 bn-36luu, T4 this bone). Gate: last trend row must equal the live measurement. Result: C020 corpus 3291 reached, 0 unexposed, 0 silent, 2812 affirmed, 479 fail-closed. Semantic differential (independent evaluator ground truth, claim and assumption side) 3000 gated pairs plus 24000 extended: 0 unsound, 0 silent, normalize meaning-preserving. Named assay: 37 attacks in 4 families, 35 exposed, 2 rejected at decode, 0 silent. Boundaries: K09-P02 policy-only loosening allows with no record (DX02-B14, closed only by intent.lock monotonicity). Latent verb cells: security_policy:no-removal:weakened, optimization:no-removal:added (classifier-less today, fail closed to review). Main scope gap: no production path calls the diff (continuumd intent.diff/propose_revision return UnsupportedSemanticFeature). Package: notes/plan/notes/KILL09_CHECKPOINT.md, recommends CONTINUE with criterion active. No decision recorded, plan §24 not annotated. just check exit 0; dossier, test-policy, check_t09_evidence pass."}	blake3:6LIUeTV5S_upzASoBKxIF07TIxj-hHzz7v7m2Aralz0
