1790191674935830	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy2RM		item.comment	bn-36wy3	{"body":"cr-3pu5cu round 4 (th-3lbzoq) fixed in fb8d74c. A truncated journal is now Inconclusive(InsufficientTelemetry) via LiftStop::Incomplete. cancellation::finish and the new lifecycle::finish check that every protocol ended. The other finishes were audited: obligation, time, effect and channel already fail closed, or their open state is a legitimate end state. The A7 end condition was added. Truncation sweeps cover every prefix of the A7 and deadline corpora (mid-protocol never conforms, complete prefixes always do), plus an anti-vacuity test. just check: all pass except the lead-owned security-review-present."}	blake3:vXgvl-o4Sp6JxO-LxGyEimthCXIx5XxTEycptAfGyVY
