1790196801757364	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy6xM		item.comment	bn-10j7z	{"body":"cr-3aqchd round 5 fixed in 2dd38ab. The plain schema plan now charges each ActionDecl: 1 node, the name, and the update target names. Audit fixes: update and relational target names, variable and predicate records, and each initial state with its bindings are now charged. lowered_actions is now counters, with no second name copy. 5 exact delta and boundary tests added; 9 mutants killed. Behaviour change: under default limits a wide init now refuses as output_too_large before too_many_initial_states. just check: green except security-review-present (lead-owned)."}	blake3:AgYxwEr5wftjCGdin2iwWRuvhe-0XT2Yol-W1PxXLqg
