1790203762179707	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEymhQ		item.create	bn-35y4f	{"description":"bn-2npu found that 7 of 12 producer mutants of the reference engine pass the kernel: 4 emitter faults and 3 evaluator faults. Each one writes a closed, in-domain relation that is not the model's. The kernel sees the model only as a digest, so it cannot tell. Deliver a checker that re-derives the successor relation from the model, or bind the relation to the model digest. Then rerun the bn-2npu producer campaign. This is the path to promoting C018.","kind":"task","labels":["phase-b","req:phase-b","req:c018"],"title":"C018: bind the finite-closure successor relation to the model, so a producer's evaluator or emitter fault cannot pass the kernel (bn-2npu follow-up)"}	blake3:aLTxIMWJOa-_4ibux0ZWMNLHQPTKZ6VxGbgbDUumYLw
