1790208402252930	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyuxQ		item.create	bn-3s72q	{"description":"continuum-kernel-temporal's fair-SCC certificate carries weak fairness of single actions only. bn-1ln12 models fairness as weak or strong over a set of actions (the union scope). Extend the certificate wire and the kernel check so that union and strong fairness are certifiable. Until then, a liveness result under such fairness must not be presented as certified. This is a kernel change: GOV §4, two reviewers.","kind":"task","labels":["phase-b","req:phase-b"],"title":"Fair-SCC certificate wire: union scopes and strong fairness (bn-1ln12 follow-up)"}	blake3:JKMoKmm8CP77h3zoQhmtHOtYFwVkhDSxJsbcPApv0xw
