1790213316297160	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy0xQ		item.create	bn-47rug	{"description":"Over 7 Codex rounds (cr-10mg1y, cr-3i3rst), bn-2npu showed that a lexical scan of Rust source cannot enumerate the public verdict surface of the checking base. The routes found were aliases, raw identifiers, path redirects, callable statics, and trait-associated callable consts (the last is a pinned known miss). Derive the public API from compiler data instead: rustdoc JSON, if the pinned toolchain supports it, or a vetted tool. A new crate needs a human-recorded dependency audit. Then assert that exactly one wire-bytes verdict entry exists per checking crate, and that no public item of any kind yields a verdict or a callable from non-wire input.","kind":"task","labels":["phase-b","req:phase-b","req:c018","security","risk:high"],"title":"Checking-base public API surface derived from rustc, replacing the lexical TCB-02 scan (bn-2npu follow-up)"}	blake3:o6s1V_XE5qHBkB2d1xPHZGPWqJIJzwU0Ybn718oCzec
